<title>USA: Commonwealth Aluminum Q4 shr up to $0.55.</title>
<headline>Commonwealth Aluminum Q4 shr up to $0.55.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
