<p>NOTE: 1996 results include September 20, 1996 acquisition of CasTech.</p>
<p>1996 Q4 recognizes a $3.7 million tax benefit for the acquisition of CasTech as well as an adjustment of prior tax provisions.</p>
<p>The company had compensation-related adjustments in the fourth quarter that incresed pre-tax income by about $1.1 million.</p>
<p>1996 results also include a $1.4 million extraordinary chrage for paying off debt early.</p>
<p>1995 results include a tax settlement and income from a disposed investment that together increase net income by $3.3 milion or $0.32 per share.</p>
